<div><p class="fb-chip fb-chip-2">Tool 01</p><h2 class="rv">Cushion zone mapper</h2><p class="fb-p">Different activities press on different parts of the foot. Pick what you will do in your socks and we map where cushioning helps most, then suggest the sock style to look for.</p>
<div class="fb-acts" id="zn-a" role="group" aria-label="Activity"><button type="button" data-v="0" class="on">Walking</button><button type="button" data-v="1">Running</button><button type="button" data-v="2">Hiking</button><button type="button" data-v="3">Standing all day</button><button type="button" data-v="4">Gym &amp; court</button><button type="button" data-v="5">Office</button></div>
<div class="fb-zn-r" aria-live="polite"><p class="fb-hand" id="zn-k">best match</p><h3 id="zn-t"></h3><p id="zn-d"></p><dl class="fb-zl" id="zn-l"></dl></div><div class="fb-zn-i"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1696964904681-7ae16f82ceef?auto=format&fit=crop&w=320&h=240&q=75" alt="a woman running up a mountain hill" width="320" height="240" loading="lazy"></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1733744237984-cda5232362ba?auto=format&fit=crop&w=320&h=240&q=75" alt="a hiker standing on a rocky hill" width="320" height="240" loading="lazy"></figure></div></div></div></section>

<section class="fb-s fb-ft2" id="fit"><div class="fb-w fb-fit-g"><div><p class="fb-chip">Tool 02</p><h2 class="rv">Sock &amp; shoe fit check</h2><p class="fb-p">A thick sock in a snug shoe pinches; a thin sock in a roomy boot slides. Tell us about your shoe and sock and we check whether they work together.</p>
