<p class="fb-lb">Shoe type</p><div class="fb-seg" id="ft-k"><button type="button" class="on" data-v="0">Sneaker</button><button type="button" data-v="1">Running shoe</button><button type="button" data-v="2">Hiking boot</button><button type="button" data-v="3">Dress shoe</button></div><figure class="fb-fit-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1789121127406-73561792173d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=220&q=75" alt="a person adjusting a trail running shoe" width="520" height="220" loading="lazy"></figure></div>
